Conclusion:
By following the steps outlined in this document, you can successfully create a new schema/stage for the FL region with proper signing and build configurations in the Subway Mobile App pipeline. These steps ensure that the APK is properly signed, assembled, and uploaded to App Center for deployment.
Repeat the same process for other regions by adjusting the stage, variable templates, signing keys, and APK destinations accordingly.
